Description:
 ros-one-octomap-server - octomap_server loads a 3D map (as Octree-based OctoMap) and distr
Changes:
 ros-one-octomap-server (0.6.8-2025.02.14.07.08) noble; urgency=high
 .
   * Change frame id "/map" to "map" to prevent RViz visualization warnings in ROS Noetic caused by tf (#124 <https://github.com/octomap/octomap_mapping/issues/124>
   * Initialize quaternion to avoid RViz warning (#112 <https://github.com/octomap/octomap_mapping/issues/112>)
   * Update for PCL deprecated and removed API (#118 <https://github.com/octomap/octomap_mapping/issues/118>)
   * Update pluginlib headers (#114 <https://github.com/OctoMap/octomap_mapping/issues/114>)
   * Update boost::placeholders (#105 <https://github.com/octomap/octomap_mapping/issues/105>)
   * Fix publishing of projected map on reset (#92 <https://github.com/octomap/octomap_mapping/issues/92>)
   * Add a min range parameter (#100 <https://github.com/octomap/octomap_mapping/issues/100>)
   * Contributors: Lovro Markovic, Lucas Walter, Wolfgang Merkt, Zhefan-Xu, yuri-r
